{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_035mco_1_5_035_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_01:1_5_035_01:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_01:1_5_035_01:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_01:1_5_035_01:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_01:1_5_035_01:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b13bec4686b0f3a2c03d6c47da02ae97a709ee6bd7da8ef65aefdf5d924bc5ca",
      "text": "主演西装CM的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_01:1_5_035_01:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4544e8c5950bc6a05e4d7a23f1b732b104fec927108e1ee0033567c30228f13d",
      "text": "让您久等了。\n这是前几天量身定做的西装。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_01:1_5_035_01:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d312ffa7b4a90ff8adc68044f2cf9583021f684a2b8815857cfe4300a6453653",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー。\n那么，我这就试穿一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_01:1_5_035_01:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42ad5deb66b11e9d0dff847447ebf591679b8ba436ff1900784695e3ad432dfa",
      "text": "道夫先生，试穿后的感觉怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_01:1_5_035_01:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:685c2262371c2d6f39accddb39958cdf0492c9efe085c0fdd6d89b15997d3809",
      "text": "嗯，尺寸非常合身，穿着舒适，\n活动起来也十分自如。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_01:1_5_035_01:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ef9923d63f09898de9976fc62f17c535e9c72700465959fa0f10100c230f9d1",
      "text": "而且是标准色调，\n能适用于各种场合吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_01:1_5_035_01:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:547ab446460eb2a5b95b9c1625f9ec843f09c3dc914f7a6f16b64f3c51113d2b",
      "text": "再者，如果使用的是资料上记载的面料，\n透气性也相当值得期待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_01:1_5_035_01:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eec8ccc813ecb2084e6f13fab4da74afa497ba093428f056e330df8447d7349e",
      "text": "也是推荐给●●●●プロデューサー的一件良品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_01:1_5_035_01:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a026f3dbc607410cb3b02a1339a44e5911eeb3f2e325ef506ab409f38b59252b",
      "text": "原来如此，竟然是这么棒的西装啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_01:1_5_035_01:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e4c2f10e2bce9301babca0e7557b30f06b34a314e31a657a9499dd6c4614dc7",
      "text": "听了道夫先生的感想，\n我也变得非常心动了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_01:1_5_035_01:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c24768dfb47383552d8c24f36d885b8e06cb228c47f75b9068332b31f7fd856",
      "text": "是吗。那么为了让看了CM的人也能有同样的感受，\n我自当全力以赴。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
